"""Second Life (off-label modes) and Edge-AI Hook for the parts v50 lacks.

v50's Sensor Catalog carries two columns I had no equivalent of, and they are
among the best things in it: what a part does when used OFF-label, and what
model you would run on its output. This file supplies both for the 175 sensors
being merged in, so the catalog stays uniform rather than becoming two tiers.

Keyed by stable ID. Format: id -> (second_life, edge_ai_hook)
"""

